    "c1_auroc": "control C1 -- action-type + click-bucket base rate within-frame grouped AUROC; the free per-16px-bucket signal the live agent already has (PersistentAEM). Seed-free.",
    "c2_auroc": "control C2 -- object-property-only (color, area, is_rect) model, SAME within-frame ranking objective as the object model; isolates the lift of patch/shape/topology over bare object salience so a ColorBlobSaliencePrior re-derivation cannot pass.",
    "duration_s": "wall-clock of corpus load + featurize + multi-seed LOO + online eval; no LLM/GPU, 1s floor.",
    "gate_passed": "bool per eval (offline / online): object adds > 0.05 over max(C1,C2) on the WORST seed AND beats the untrained control AND positive control passes AND pairs >= min.",
